      "lineNbr": 31,
      "author": {
        "id": 1965911
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-25T11:56:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Reusing registration lock might cause deadlocks\nIn this case\n-Thread1 calling pkvm_iommu_host_stage2_idmap\nlocking order  mmu_lock \u003d\u003e registration_lock\n\n-Thread2 calling __pkvm_iommu_driver_init\nlocking order registration_lock \u003d\u003e mmu_lock\n\n\nAfter finalizing we would stop driver registration, so we shouldn\u0027t need the lock. I was thinking of having ptr to function for lock and unlock which are switched to empty functions after finalize.",
      "parentUuid": "c7c3f034_917a4b82",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 31,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 31,
        "endChar": 43
      },
